#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:10002
#: 1897ad1c68de4324b5b7f1e0feacce37
msgid "Control Analysis: Plant Modeling from Measured Response"
msgstr "制御解析: 実測応答からのプラントモデリング"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:20002
#: 6aa48a1a4b4840b6952309524b29bbba
msgid ""
"This notebook promotes the legacy system-identification example into the "
"public tutorial set. The modeling step matters because a controller should "
"be designed against the part of the response that is both **physically "
"meaningful** and **measured with high coherence**."
msgstr ""
"この notebook は legacy の system identification 例を公開 docs "
"用に整理したものです。大切なのは、**高コヒーレンスで物理的に意味のある帯域だけを使ってモデルを当てる** ことです。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:20004
#: 0ba7079db89b495ab696bb47acd9c296
msgid ""
"We regenerate a resonant plant, estimate its transfer function, select a "
"trustworthy frequency range, and fit a compact second-order model."
msgstr "ここでは共振プラントを再生成し、伝達関数を測り、信頼できる周波数点だけを選んで 2 次モデルを当てます。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:40002
#: 82a0cc05d3d348d3b8678adcf615739f
msgid "1. Keep only the physically trustworthy band"
msgstr "1\\. 高コヒーレンス帯域だけを残す"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:40004
#: 8e5cc8eb2b974a789a63b79a2b414f8b
msgid ""
"A good model fit uses frequencies where the plant dominates and the "
"measurement is coherent. Low-coherence points usually indicate noise "
"domination or unmodeled dynamics."
msgstr "低コヒーレンス点は雑音優勢または非線形性の疑いがあるので、そこを含めてしまうとプラントの物理量より推定器の都合をフィットしてしまいます。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:60002
#: 2b2413972bd541a2bbcf9398af08f093
msgid "2. Fit a resonator model"
msgstr "2\\. 共振モデルを当てる"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:60004
#: 5ac627bc746e4b899e1c86ca4cf3d900
msgid ""
"The fitted parameters have direct physical meaning: gain sets actuation "
"scale, `f0` gives the resonance frequency, and `Q` gives the damping width."
msgstr "フィットで得たいのはゲイン、共振周波数 `f0`、減衰幅を表す `Q` で、どれも制御設計にそのまま効くパラメータです。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:80002
#: 201d84d306894890b75ee56f7812cdb1
msgid "3. Compare the fitted model with the measurement"
msgstr "3\\. 測定とモデルを比較する"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_control_modeling.ipynb:80004
#: 19ad10e74a5442c5a97f964772880b69
msgid ""
"A credible plant model should match both the peak location and the width of "
"the measured resonance, not just one point on the curve."
msgstr "信頼できるプラントモデルは、曲線上の 1 点だけでなく、実測された共振のピーク位置と幅の両方を再現すべきです。"
